  "question": "What\u2019s the nearest museum along the path leading from Adventure Sports in Hershey, Hershey, PA to Arts by the Bay Gallery, Havre de Grace, MD?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-76.62265 40.236123)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-76.08988 39.550044)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'museum'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-76.62265 40.236123)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-76.62265 40.236123)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
